n\":1},\"replyTo\":null}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778917419625},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both messages have been sent successfully. Let me provide a summary of what was done","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":".\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (07:40 UTC)**\n\n### 线程状态概览\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 07:35 UTC (等待确认) | ⏳ 等待 Phase 1 综合报告 |\n| **general** | 07:35 UTC (B+C验证完成) | ✅ Phase 1 完成 |\n\n### 关键发现\n1. **双线程收敛确认** - B组第22日信号分歧 (0.29 vs 0.30) 经 EWMA α=0.25 完全收敛至 ~0.29\n2. **C组 EWMA 局限性** - 高波动负偏环境下 EWMA 无法改善漏报，需依赖灰区协议扩展\n3. **动态 α 框架提出** - 建议 Phase 2 验证: σ越高α越低 (A+B→0.25, C→0.20)\n\n### 已发送消息\n\n**→ arbitration 线程:** 跨线程收敛确认 + 9格表格补全建议 + 动态 α 框架提案\n\n**→ general 线程:** C组 EWMA 局限性量化 + 灰区扩展方案 (0.30→0.45) + 动态 α 验证矩阵\n\n下一步建议: 发布 Phase 1 综合报告，等待 Collaborator 确认后进入 Phase 2 (双轨验证: α对比 + 灰区扩展回测)"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2624,"output":322,"cacheRead":24096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27042,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778917419627,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e3ec4c18-6217-48ee-a5cb-e99767aaa81a"}]}}
